No, girls, stay.

164
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:36,720
她要是都不挣扎 那还有什么乐趣啊
If she's not even going to put up a fight, what's the fun?

165
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,100
真的不吃吗
Are you sure?

166
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:41,680
培根末哦 天堂的味道
Bacon drizzle, little bit of heaven.

167
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:43,880
不 我不想吃
No, I don't want them.

168
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,120
好吧 那我把小蛋糕放这里
Okay, let's put the cupcakes here,

169
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,340
以防你改变主意想吃
in case you change your mind.

170
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,460
这是一把枪吗
Is this a gun?

171
00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:54,340
是的 我才不要用刀捅死自己呢
Yes. I'm not going to stab myself to death.

172
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,760
你知道这外套值多少钱吗
Do you know how much this outfit costs?

173
00:07:57,700 --> 00:07:59,640
苏菲 你一定会挺过来的
Sophie, you're going to get through this.

174
00:07:59,740 --> 00:08:02,080
对了 你穿黑色美呆了
And by the way, you look amazing in black.

175
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:05,660
现在我的心情不想穿亮色
Oh, well, no more bright colors for me now.

176
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:07,160
哀悼期间只穿丧服黑
I'm in mourning.

177
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:11,560
瞧 黑色胸罩 黑色吊袜带
See? Black bra, black garters,

178
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:13,560
还有 黑色内裤
and look, black panties.

179
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:17,440
可你没有穿内裤啊
Um, you're not wearing any panties.

180
00:08:18,620 --> 00:08:19,320
没有吗
I'm not?

181
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:24,700
抱歉让你看见下面那堆茂盛的杂草了
I'm sorry about that wild mess down there.

182
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:29,300
苏菲 你被人骗我也感到难过
Sophie, I feel bad you got ripped off.

183
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:32,260
这是我今晚赚的小费 一共27块
Here are all my tips from tonight: $27.

184
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,240
八小时就赚这么点啊
For eight hours?

185
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:38,340
好吧 现在我替你感到难过了
Oh, now, I'm depressed for you.

186
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:40,180
你想借用我的枪吗
You want to borrow my gun?

187
00:08:40,933 --> 00:08:44,060
我觉得你只需要吃点东西
You know what? I think you just need to eat something,

188
00:08:44,060 --> 00:08:46,580
很快 你就能恢复到原来的样子了
And pretty soon, you'll be back to your old self:

189
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:49,660
一个乐善好施 不求回报的女人
A woman who gives gifts and expects nothing in return,

190
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,480
因为礼物的定义正是如此
'cause that's what a gift is.

191
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,580
苏菲 那有让你感觉爽点吗
Sophie, is that doing anything for you?

192
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:58,400
反正我也不反感啊
Yeah, well, I'm not hating it.

193
00:09:00,420 --> 00:09:02,480
这汤闻起来味道不错
Here, this soup smells amazing.

194
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:05,100
不要 我没有力气吃东西
Oh, no. I don't have the energy to eat.

195
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:08,580
苏菲 张开嘴 放进去
Sophie, open your mouth and put this in.

196
00:09:08,620 --> 00:09:10,300
拜托 你这样就跟奥列格一样坏了
Oh, come on. Now you're as bad as Oleg.

197
00:09:13,260 --> 00:09:14,196
乖了 好点没
There. Better?

198
00:09:14,196 --> 00:09:16,746
汤冷死了
That's cold.

199
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:21,220
苏菲 只要你开口 银行我都帮你抢
Sophie, just say the word, and I will rob a bank for you.

200
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,080
苏菲 我知道你很受伤
Sophie, I understand you're hurting,

201
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:25,320
但我们几乎把钱都花在那家店上了
but we've already spent most of the money on the shop,

202
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:27,140
而且现在生意也不好
and business just isn't good.

203
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:28,720
不是钱的问题
It's not the money.

204
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,900
大家都觉得是钱的问题
Everybody thinks it's the money.

205
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,460
远不止如此
It's more than that.

206
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:35,500
我的湖边小屋是我的梦想 我失去的是梦想
My lake house was my dream, and I lost my dream.

207
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:37,180
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God!

208
00:09:37,420 --> 00:09:39,600
能搞清这点就太好了
Well, I'm glad that's cleared up.

209
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,680
不是钱的问题
Not about the money.

210
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:42,600
麦克斯 走吧 她受惊吓了
Max, come on, she's had a shock,

211
00:09:42,620 --> 00:09:43,560
我们应该让她好好睡觉
we should let her sleep.

212
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:46,520
你们俩真幸运 梦想还没破碎
You girls are so lucky. You still have your dream.

213
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:49,380
苏菲 你也成为我们梦想的一份子呢
Well, Sophie, what if you were part of our dream?

214
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:50,740
什么 谁的梦想
I'm sorry? Whose dream?

215
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:52,180
我们的梦想
Our dream.

216
00:09:52,620 --> 00:09:55,180
你们的梦想 小蛋糕在哪里
Your dream? Where's that cupcake?

217
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:58,620
苏菲给了那笔钱 我们才能开成小蛋糕店
Look, Sophie's the only reason we have a shop.

218
00:09:58,700 --> 00:09:59,960
我们应该...让她当合伙人
We should make her, like, a partner.

219
00:10:01,340 --> 00:10:01,960
合伙人
Partner!

220
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:04,740
但咱们已经是合伙人了
But you and I are already partners.

221
00:10:04,820 --> 00:10:06,500
我觉得已经有点人满为患了吧
I feel like we're kind of partnered out.

222
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,160
不然就当静默合伙人好了
What about a silent partner?

223
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:12,040
静默合伙人 我喜欢
Silent partner! Yeah, I like that.

224
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:15,040
我的食欲都开始恢复了
I'm getting my appetite back,

225
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:17,920
连性欲都回来了
and also, my sex drive.

226
00:10:19,220 --> 00:10:21,840
要走要留 随便你俩 反正老子是要上了
Go or stay, girls. Either way, I'm going in.

227
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:34,440
抱歉我说可以让苏菲成为蛋糕店的合伙人
I'm sorry I said Sophie could be part of the store.

228
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,940
我只是为她感到难过
I just felt bad for her,

229
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:37,620
躺在床上 全身黑衣
lying there, all in black,

230
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,760
悲伤到都没心情打理"小妹妹"了
too sad to even make her junk pretty.

231
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:42,360
没关系啦
It's fine.

232
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:44,820
"静默合伙人"只是个挂名职位
"Silent partner" is just a figurehead role anyway,

233
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:47,060
而且知道你有如此善心也挺好的
and it's nice to know you have such a big heart.

234
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,340
这不是我的本心
It's not my heart.

235
00:10:48,420 --> 00:10:50,260
看到那团东西后改变了我的心
What I saw down there changed me.

236
00:10:52,580 --> 00:10:54,240
那看起来就像是动物为了过冬
It looks like something an animal built

237
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,360
而造的避寒兽穴
to live in for the winter.

238
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:06,320
慢着 苏菲的大吊灯在这里干嘛
Wait, what is Sophie's chandelier doing here?

239
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:08,840
这是波兰版的入侵民宅吗
Is this the polish version of a home invasion?

240
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,840
闯进去然后留下点俗气的东西
They break in and leave something tacky?

241
00:11:11,980 --> 00:11:13,980
早上好 合伙人们
Good morning, partners.

242
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:18,020
我不知道着装要求 所以我就穿了商务便装
I didn't know the dress code, so I went business casual.

243
00:11:19,260 --> 00:11:23,040
瞧 我为我的湖边小屋买的大吊灯
Look, the chandelier that I bought for my lake house.

244
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:26,100
现在我们的梦想合二为一了
Oh, now our dreams are together.

245
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:29,700
苏菲 这跟我们原来的风格大相径庭
Sophie, it's not the look we were going for.

246
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:32,500
我知道 好看多了 对吧
Oh, I know. Much better, right?

247
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:36,260
这绝对不是我们的风格
That is definitely not our style.

248
00:11:36,660 --> 00:11:39,140
这里像被蒂姆·波顿的诡异电影横扫过一样
It looks like a Tim Burton movie just spit up in here.

249
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:41,920
我觉得还挺漂亮的啊
I think it's kind of pretty.

250
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:43,500
但我懂屁啊
But what do I know?

251
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:45,660
我有次把仅有的50块拿去买青蛙彩陶罐
I once spent my last 50 bucks on a frog pinata.

252
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:48,340
忍不住想买啊
Had to have it.

253
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:52,140
麦克斯自制小蛋糕店
Max's homemade cupcakes.

254
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:55,220
对 我们是一家上档次的蛋糕店
Yes, we're an upscale bakery, and--

255
00:11:55,220 --> 00:11:56,880
现在我们还卖何奇三明治哦
Now, we sell hoagies.

256
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:00,640
不不不 先生 我们不卖何奇三明治
Oh, no, no, no, sir, we do not sell hoagies.

257
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,540
不 我们卖
Yes, we do.

258
00:12:03,620 --> 00:12:05,520
你想要多少 我去拿笔记一下
How many would you like? Let me get a pen.

259
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:11,820
怎么了
What's happening?

260
00:12:11,900 --> 00:12:13,400
你终于要来说卡洛琳的坏话了吗
Are we finally gonna trash Caroline?

261
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,180
不 我需要你的帮忙
No, I need your help.

262
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,320
我连续不断地看了四部爱情烂片
I watched four chick flicks back-to-back,

263
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:19,240
想出了几个告诉
then I made a list of possible ways

264
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,500
卡洛琳我爱她的可行办法
to tell Caroline I love her.

265
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,860
我本来还想多列几个 但我看得月经都来了
I was gonna make more, but I got my period.

266
00:12:26,060 --> 00:12:29,980
好的 把你的选项都跟我说一遍
Okay, run the choices past me.

267
00:12:30,060 --> 00:12:31,940
哪一个让我听了最想吐
Whichever one makes me want to hurl the most,

268
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:32,620
就是最佳的选择了
that's your winner.

269
00:12:33,820 --> 00:12:35,800
我可以在她公寓外放歌
I could play a song for her outside of her apartment,

270
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:38,600
不过都2012年了 大手提收音机很难找
but keep in mind how hard it is to find a boom box in 2012.

271
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,360
对啊 而且如果你在我们公寓外面搞这个
Yeah, plus, if you do that outside our apartment,

272
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,100
你会被我...
you'll be shot.

273
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:44,000
乱抢射死
by me.

274
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:48,340
好吧 那在中央公园的溜冰场
Okay, what about sharing cocoa and a hot dog

275
00:12:48,340 --> 00:12:49,573
俩人共喝热可可 共享热狗时呢
on the ice rink in central park?

276
00:12:49,573 --> 00:12:50,984
行 就这个
Yup, that's it.

277
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:52,900
让我想把自己的脑袋扯下来
Makes me want to take my head off

278
00:12:52,900 --> 00:12:54,020
然后扔到大街上去
and throw it into the street.

279
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,360
很好 对了 麦克斯
Cool. Oh, and, Max,

280
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:58,100
我觉得我是地球上唯一能区别
I think I'm the only straight guy on earth

281
00:12:58,100 --> 00:13:00,025
迪伦·麦克德莫特与
who knows the difference between Dylan Mcdermott and

282
00:13:00,025 --> 00:13:00,900
德蒙特·莫罗尼的直男了
Dermott Mulroney,

283
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:02,620
而朋友 这就是爱啊
and that, my friend, is love.

284
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:07,323
这是什么狗屁味道
Oh, what's that funky-ass smell?

285
00:13:07,323 --> 00:13:10,563
出意大利香肠味的除臭剂了吗
Do they finally sell pepperoni febreze?

286
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:13,740
麦克斯 这样完全不行
Max, this already isn't working.

287
00:13:13,820 --> 00:13:16,140
臭哄哄的蒜味香肠 艳俗的大吊灯
The stinky salami, the gaudy chandelier?

288
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:18,440
这就像一家闹鬼的快餐店
It's like a haunted Quiznos in here.

289
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:22,340
我让奥列格去皇后区
Hey, I'm sending Oleg to Queens

290
00:13:22,340 --> 00:13:23,840
买一箱柑橘味饮料 没错
to pick up a flat of Fresca. Yeah.

291
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:26,820
冰柑橘饮料配何奇三明治
There's nothing better with a hoagie

292
00:13:26,820 --> 00:13:28,580
可是最棒的组合
than an ice-cold fresca.

293
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:31,180
我就是在想着那个呢
That's what I wanted!

294
00:13:31,940 --> 00:13:32,340
听着
Look...

295
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:35,600
配上腌鸡蛋风味更佳哦
they'll go great with the pickled eggs!

296
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:41,580
我的梦想正式变成了恶梦
This just went from my dream to a nightmare.

297
00:13:42,220 --> 00:13:44,720
天啊 卡洛琳 真的是你
Oh, my God, Caroline! It is you!

298
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:47,500
史黛西 不是吧 毕业后我就没见过你了
Stacy, no way! I haven't seen you since graduation.

299
00:13:47,500 --> 00:13:49,180
我们一起念的沃顿商学院
We went to Wharton together.

300
00:13:49,460 --> 00:13:51,580
这个姑娘是个天才
This girl is a genius.

301
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,200
永远都是班级第一
Always top of the class.

302
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:54,770
你在这里干嘛
So what are you doing here?

303
00:13:54,770 --> 00:13:57,660
坐拥世界的空挡出来买个小蛋糕吗
Buying a cupcake on your way to running the world?

304
00:13:57,660 --> 00:13:59,100
不 这家店是我开的
No, I own this shop.

305
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,980
这家小蛋糕店是你开的啊
You own this little cupcake shop?

306
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:06,360
当然还有其他更大的店面啦
And many other bigger shops.

307
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:08,540
这是我们威廉斯堡新开的分店
This is our new Williamsburg location.

308
00:14:08,980 --> 00:14:11,020
没错 我知道 那个吊灯完全不搭
And yes, I know, the chandelier is all wrong.

309
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:14,220
我跟设计师说 我们太平洋西北地区的分店
I told the designer, none of our pacific northwest locations

310
00:14:14,220 --> 00:14:15,320
都不许挂这么俗气的吊灯
will have the chandeliers.

311
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:18,780
你这么厉害 25岁坐拥小蛋糕帝国很正常
Of course, you'd own a cupcake empire at 25.

312
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:21,680
-这位是麦克斯 -你好
- Oh, and this is Max. - Hi.

313
00:14:22,100 --> 00:14:24,780
我刚从大西北地区分店调过来
I just transferred from our Boise location.

314
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,200
是什么东西这么臭啊
What's that horrible smell?

315
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:31,700
是一种叫"何奇三明治"的玩意
It's something called a "hoagie."

316
00:14:32,180 --> 00:14:34,400
工人们都喜欢吃 对吧 麦克斯
The workers like them. Right, Max?

317
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,360
是的 谢谢你的何奇三明治[西语]
Si, gracias por la hoagie.

318
00:14:39,700 --> 00:14:41,100
我得走了
Well, I have to go.

319
00:14:41,180 --> 00:14:43,180
我在楼上的BBD&L公司做顾问
I'm consulting upstairs at BBD&L.

320
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:45,320
-楼上啊 -对啊
- Oh, upstairs. - Yeah.

321
00:14:45,420 --> 00:14:46,880
就知道你一定会东山再起
Always knew you'd land on your feet.

322
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:49,920
有时间去喝一杯 你请客哦 大亨
Let's go for drinks, and you're paying, mogul.

323
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:54,600
希望她喜欢喝水啊
I hope she likes water.

324
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:58,400
我现在该怎么办 史黛西在这栋楼上班
Now what am I going to do? Stacy's in the building.

325
00:14:58,740 --> 00:15:01,500
你可以搬去奇幻世界开一家你说的分店啊
Well, you could move to Narnia and run that branch,

326
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,140
你个病态的骗子
you pathological liar.

327
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:07,460
麦克斯 我不想让人们看见我这样
Max, this is not how I want people to see me,

328
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:09,240
或闻到我有这股味
or smell me, quite frankly.

329
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:12,080
我们必须摆脱蒜味香肠 大吊灯
We have to get rid of the salami, the chandelier,

330
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:12,760
还有苏菲
and the Sophie.

331
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,380
这是我们的梦想 不是她的
This is our dream, not hers.

332
00:15:14,520 --> 00:15:16,280
好吧 我会告诉她
Okay, fine, I'll tell her.

333
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:19,020
苏菲 我们有话跟你说
Hey, Sophie, can we talk to you?

334
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:21,340
好消息 姑娘们
Good news, girls.

335
00:15:21,620 --> 00:15:23,720
现在我们还卖刮刮乐哦
Now we sell scratchers.

336
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:27,260
但我有个更好的主意
But I have even a better idea.

337
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:31,120
你们俩打扮成小蛋糕
You two should dress up as big cupcakes

338
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:32,980
去外面分派免费的试吃品
and pass out free samples.

339
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:39,160
苏菲 麦克斯有话要跟你说
Sophie, Max has something she wants to say to you.

340
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:39,820
打住
Wait.

341
00:15:40,900 --> 00:15:43,880
姑娘们 让我先说
Girls, I have something to say first.

342
00:15:46,180 --> 00:15:51,020
两天前 我一度徘徊于自杀的边缘
Two days ago, I was on the verge of suicide.

343
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:54,420
说真的 我绝食了整整一下午呢
Yeah, seriously, I hadn't eaten all afternoon.

344
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:58,420
但你们对自己梦想的慷慨
But your generosity with your dream

345
00:15:58,420 --> 00:16:02,020
给了我东山再起和打理杂"毛"的动力
has given me a reason to get up and get a wax.

346
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:03,191
是的
Yeah.

347
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:12,460
麦克斯 你刚刚想说什么来着
Max, there was something you wanted to say?

348
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:18,460
我本来是想说...
I was going to say--

349
00:16:18,460 --> 00:16:19,620
你看起来真可口
You look delicious.

350
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:24,040
我简直就像甜心波波的肥婆老妈去舞会
I look like Honey Boo Boo's mom at the prom.

351
00:16:31,980 --> 00:16:34,000
这太丢人了
This is so humiliating.

352
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,820
现在我知道超模泰拉
Now I know how Tyra felt

353
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:37,800
做节目 扮成胖子上街时的感觉了
when she went undercover as that fat person.

354
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:40,220
拜托告诉我这是我们堕落的极限了
Please tell me this is our bottom.

355
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,660
这是你的极限
Well, it's your bottom.

356
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:43,220
我有次去酒吧喝酒
I went to happy hour once

357
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:45,060
醒来时发现自己在布朗克斯动物园的
and woke up naked in the penguin habitat

358
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:46,060
企鹅栖息地 浑身赤裸着
at the Bronx Zoo.

359
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:48,800
还有我当年做过的"事"哦
And I did things.

360
00:16:51,900 --> 00:16:52,940
姑娘们
Hey, girls.

361
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:55,840
你们俩呆站在这里干嘛
What are you two doing just standing there?

362
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:58,820
上帝给小蛋糕两条腿是有理由的
God gave cupcakes legs for a reason.

363
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:01,500
你们得走上街头
You need to hit the streets,

364
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:04,880
摇晃你们的"蛋糕" 展示你们的"好货"
shake your cake maker, and show people your goods.

365
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:07,900
别看我呀 是香草白妞不愿意
Hey, don't look at me, it's vanilla.

366
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:10,260
我还期待着走到
I was looking forward to going up

367
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:11,560
街上完全陌生的人们面前
to complete strangers on the street

368
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:13,420
大声嚷着"吃我" 但她不愿意去
and saying "eat me," but she won't leave.

369
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:18,020
如果你们不出去拉客
Well, if you're not going to go out and get the customers,

370
00:17:18,020 --> 00:17:20,080
那我只好帮你们带客上门了
then I'll have to bring the customers to you.

371
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:22,820
真是什么事都得靠我做啊
I gotta do everything around here.

372
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:27,480
说真的 我不敢相信我们就在这呆站着
Seriously, I can't believe we're just standing here

373
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,500
我们应该在享受追着路上胖子跑
when we could be chasing fat people down the street,

374
00:17:29,500 --> 00:17:30,860
对他们喊"你吃了我的兄弟"才对啊
yelling, "You ate my brother!"

375
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:34,340
瞧瞧你俩
Look at you two.

376
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:36,440
能再给我一大杯牛奶配 那就更好了
What I wouldn't give for a giant glass of milk.

377
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:38,260
瞧瞧你
Look at you, though.

378
00:17:38,260 --> 00:17:39,200
看起来真可爱
You look so cute.

379
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:40,740
才没有 别看我
No, don't look at me.

380
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:42,600
穿这玩意真是丢脸死了
I'm totally embarrassed in this thing.

381
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:45,400
是啊 她又可爱又尴尬
Yes, she's cute and embarrassed,

382
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:48,060
穿着五彩缤纷站在公共场合 最适合...
in a larger-than-life, colorful, public setting.

383
00:17:50,502 --> 00:17:51,500
对啊
Ah, right.

384
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:53,600
卡洛琳 听着 我想对你说...
So, Caroline, listen, I wanted to--

385
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:56,540
姑娘们 一些年轻的上班族来了
Look, girls, some young professionals.

386
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:58,640
天啊 她还把史黛西拉来了
Oh, my God! She's bringing stacy.

387
00:17:59,100 --> 00:17:59,940
不能让她瞧见我穿这个
She can't see me in this.

388
00:17:59,980 --> 00:18:01,700
我可是毕业典礼致词的学生代表 拿着
I was her valedictorian. Take this.

389
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:10,340
慢点
Wait.

390
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,480
拉我起身 麦克斯 拉我起身
Help me up, Max! Help me up!

391
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,980
好啊 你现在就跟我那肥妈一样
Oh, great. Now you're like my mom.

392
00:18:17,260 --> 00:18:18,860
来 给我你的左手
Here, give me your left hand.

393
00:18:20,420 --> 00:18:21,720
好的 再给我你的右手
Okay, give me your right hand.

394
00:18:22,780 --> 00:18:24,720
快起来 掉地上五秒内捡起还能吃
Get up! Get up! Five second rule.

395
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:38,740
你们俩疯狂的小蛋糕在干嘛
What are you two crazy cakes doing?

396
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:41,500
顾客都没了 被你们吓跑了
You lost your customers. They ran away.

397
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:42,820
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

398
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:44,960
我真不明白
Oh, I don't get it.

399
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:47,700
你也不愿意推广何奇三明治和腌鸡蛋
You won't push the hoagies or the pickled eggs.

400
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,920
你肯定很害怕成功对吧
You must really have a fear of success.

401
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:54,380
至少我们躲开史黛西了
Well, at least we missed Stacy.

402
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:57,620
你知道你还躲开了什么吗 安迪
Well, you know what else you missed? Andy.

403
00:18:57,740 --> 00:19:00,000
他本来打算告诉你他爱你
He was about to tell you he loves you.

404
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:00,760
什么
What?

405
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:03,600
就刚才在走廊 和在溜冰场时
Just now, in the hall, and at the ice rink.

406
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:05,340
他这一周千方百计想跟你说
He's been trying to tell you all week.

407
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:07,880
但我这周都醉心于工作
But I've been too preoccupied with work,

408
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:10,140
就像《假结婚》里的桑德拉·布洛克
Like Sandra Bullock in The Proposal.

409
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:14,680
他本来计划在溜冰场上告诉我吗
So he was gonna tell me at the ice rink?

410
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,980
中央公园的那个吗
The one in central park?

411
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:19,180
对啊 在你们共喝热可可 共享着热狗时
Yes, while having cocoa and splitting a hot dog.

412
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:21,080
天啊
Oh, my God!

413
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:23,500
那就是我梦想中的表白场景啊
That's, like, my dream "I love you" scenario.

414
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:25,960
为什么你不早点告诉我呢
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

415
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:29,580
因为一旦遇到其他人恶心的爱情问题
Because when it comes to other people's creepy love stuff,

416
00:19:29,580 --> 00:19:31,200
我就会变成"静默"合伙人
that's when I'm a silent partner,

417
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:34,980
你也得停止沉迷那些恶心的爱情喜剧了
And you need to stop with this creepy rom-com stuff.

418
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:36,340
因为生活不像电影
Life isn't like a movie.

419
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:39,060
有时你不可能立马获得成功
Sometimes you're not a success right away,

420
00:19:39,380 --> 00:19:41,840
有时你得默默咽下苦果 扮成一个小蛋糕
sometimes you have to just eat it and be a cupcake,

421
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:44,200
有时无论别人是在何时何地说"我爱你"
and sometimes you have to take your "I love you"

422
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:45,380
你都得接受
whichever way it comes.

423
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:48,020
你说得太对了
You are so right.

424
00:19:48,220 --> 00:19:50,140
我不需等到完美的那一刻
I don't have to wait for the moment to be perfect,

425
00:19:50,140 --> 00:19:52,400
就好像瑞茜·威瑟斯彭在《情归阿拉巴马》那样
like it was for Reese Witherspoon in Sweet Home Alabama.

426
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:56,700
我的人生不是一出爱情喜剧
My life's not a romantic comedy.

427
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:57,940
我可以用我自己的方式去做
I can do it my own way.

428
00:19:57,940 --> 00:20:00,320
就好像《我最好朋友的婚礼》里的茱莉亚·罗伯茨
Like Julia Roberts in My Best Friend's Wedding.

429
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:10,480
安迪 是我
Andy, it's me!

430
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:11,980
马上出来
I'll be right out.

431
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:13,720
不 我等不及了
No, this can't wait any longer.

432
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:15,583
我不需要盛大的浪漫喜剧时刻
I don't need a big romantic comedy moment.

433
00:20:15,583 --> 00:20:16,723
别进来
No--

434
00:20:17,980 --> 00:20:20,200
抱歉 我以为这是办公室
Oh, sorry. I thought it was the office!

435
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,580
不是
Not the office.

436
00:20:23,020 --> 00:20:24,060
我卡住了
I'm stuck.

437
00:20:24,940 --> 00:20:26,560
我想开溜 但溜不了
Oh, I want to go, but I can't.

438
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:29,020
我以后想开拉也拉不了了
And I'll never be able to go again.

439
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:33,120
我正坐在马桶上 你正穿着蛋糕服
Well, I'm on the toilet and you're in a cupcake.

440
00:20:33,420 --> 00:20:35,140
没有比这更怪的时刻了
Can't get creepier than this, so,

441
00:20:35,520 --> 00:20:37,520
卡洛琳 我爱你
Caroline, I love you.

442
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:40,860
我也爱你
I love you too.

443
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,660
拜托 把我推出去
Oh, please, push me out.

444
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,620
如何 浪漫吗
How'd it go? Was it romantic?

445
00:20:52,140 --> 00:20:53,880
他一边蹲马桶一边说爱我
He told me he loved me on the toilet.

446
00:20:55,280 --> 00:20:57,320
天啊 那是我的梦想表白场景呢
Oh, man! That's my dream scenario!

447
00:20:59,780 --> 00:21:02,200
我就只穿这个一小时
I'm only gonna do this for an hour,

448
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,920
给你们示范一下该怎么卖
to show you how it's done,

449
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,620
之后我就不干了
And then I'm out.

450
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:08,240
这是你们的梦想 不是我的
This is your dream, not mine.

451
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,720
小蛋糕 免费的小蛋糕
Cupcakes! Free cupcakes!

452
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:12,940
来嘛 尝一个
Come on, get 'em!

453
00:21:13,780 --> 00:21:15,120
要趁热吃哦
Get 'em while they're hot!
